DESCRIPTION: High Voltage Fairies in the Pit – International DJ Set & Special Guests The Fairy Pit opens up again! HIGH VOLTAGE style: Nu & Alternative Metal\, Metalcore & DnB. This time\, we’re turning up the voltage with an international act by renowned DJ Hamelin from Mexico\, bringing a Breakcore set to the pit! With special guest DJs: Rosi and Der wnr\, returning to the decks by popular demand\, joined by your very own Veranstalterin\, Fairy Mary. Buckle up\, it’s gonna be a wild night! Vienna’s only Metal & DnB Party ⚡🔥💀 🎧🔥 DJ Hamelin: Mexico Psycristrance Festival\, SUNRiCE Festival & international stages across 10+ countries 🎧🔥 DJ Rosi: Viper Room\, Weberknecht\, WUK\, Ponyhof\, Wirtshausraves & Rinderversteigerungshalle 🎧🔥 DJ wnr: Viper Room\, Weberknecht\, Wirtshausraves\, Rhiz & Underground Raves 🎧🔥 DJ Fairy Mary: your very own Veranstalterin with the classic HVF-Sound 🔊 Sounds Like: Linkin Park | Electric Callboy | Bring Me the Horizon | Motionless in White | Architects | I Prevail | Polaris | Nothing More | Escape the Fate | Bad Omens | BABYMETAL | Poppy | In This Moment | Beartooth | Falling in Reverse | Avenged Sevenfold | Rise Against | Parkway Drive | A Day to Remember | Ice Nine Kills | Enter Shikari | Landmvrks | Lorna Shore | Bullet for My Valentine | Slipknot | System of a Down | Skindred | Limp Bizkit | Papa Roach | Breaking Benjamin | Three Days Grace | Korn | Godsmack | P.O.D | Static-X | Shinedown | Hollywood Undead | Disturbed | Deftones | My Chemical Romance | Black Veil Brides | The Offspring | Sum 41 | Paramore | Evanescence | Pierce the Veil | Asking Alexandria | Thousand Foot Krutch | Pendulum | Chase & Status | The Prodigy | The Qemists | Solence | Zardonic | Kanine | Camo & Krooked | Dimension | Sub Focus | Culture Shock | Mefjus | Noisia | Insideinfo | Pythius | Freaks & Geeks | Kritikal | Riot 🤌 Goodies: 🧚‍♀️💙 Fairy Juice = Gratis Eintritts-Shots 🥃 👑 Knicklichtern & LED-Kronen 💖💫 🛍️ Merch Stand: wearing merch at our events gets you